  "description": {
   "en": "Akimi, a high school student living on a picturesque island in the Seto Inland Sea, lives with her mother, who stopped smiling due to her father's affair. One day, she becomes close to Kai, who has transferred to the island and is being swept along by his free-spirited mother's love affairs. Both harboring loneliness and emptiness within, they are drawn to each other, miss each other, and eventually grow together.",
   "ja": "「俺たちは　どうしようもなく愛を欲している」\n\n風光明媚な瀬戸内の島で、父の不倫で心を壊した母と暮らす高校生の暁海と自由奔放な母の恋愛に振り回され島に転校してきた櫂。ともに、心に孤独と欠落を抱えた2人は、暁海の父の不倫相手を訪ねたことをきっかけに、惹かれ合い、同じ夢を抱いてーー。"
  },
